                                                    "patching_rect": [ 7.0, 55.0, 393.0, 248.0 ],
                                                    "text": "snippet for jit.gl.cornerpin\n\na quad that displays videos or images and that you can stretch and adapt, ideal for simple video mapping\n\nyou can control the position of each corner with your cursor by turning ON the handles\n\nyou can also fine-tine or animate the position of the corners with float numbers\n\npress reset to reset the corners to original full position\n\nthe layer number sets the render order, whats behind and what in front,\n\nthe 3dCornerpin like the 3dLayer does not follow 3d depth but a layer order\n"
                                                }
